# NOTICE

superred-claim-prompt-shield

This module red-teams Azure AI Content Safety "Prompt Shields" as a superred
SecurityClaim. All code and the bundled seed prompts are original to this module
and licensed MIT (see LICENSE). No third-party dataset or source is vendored.

## Seed prompts

The illustrative seed set in `src/prompt_shield_claim/seeds.py` (8 attack + 6
benign) is original content authored for this module — canonical
prompt-injection patterns and plainly-benign requests, not copied from any
licensed dataset. It exists so the claim is runnable and testable out of the box
and to seed an optimizer; it is not a benchmark. Supply your own corpus via
`prompt_shield_claim(seeds=...)` for a real evaluation.

## Service under test (not vendored)

- Azure AI Content Safety — Prompt Shields, a Microsoft product. This module
  calls the public `text:shieldPrompt` REST API against the user's own resource;
  no Microsoft code or data is included.
- API reference: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/rest/api/contentsafety/text-operations/shield-prompt
  (api-version 2024-09-01). Concept: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/jailbreak-detection

